  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_system_01",
      "hash64": "A8A6F5EA807AAAB3",
      "text": "Möchtest du das Tor zum Labor Null öffnen?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_system_02",
      "hash64": "A8A6F6EA807AAC66",
      "text": "*biep*",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_system_03",
      "hash64": "A8A6F7EA807AAE19",
      "text": "Seit der letzten Authentifizierung ist zu viel Zeit\\nvergangen. Das Tor wurde verriegelt.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_sister_01",
      "hash64": "B59D7DDD3BCB7818",
      "text": "Was ist los? Hat’s nicht funktioniert?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_bbteacher_01",
      "hash64": "4E2F8664BCE0CF56",
      "text": "Damals ließ es sich öffnen, oder? Vielleicht hat\\nsich etwas am Mechanismus geändert...?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_select_01",
      "hash64": "C9FA8DC14333DF60",
      "text": "Es gab vier Schlösser.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_select_02",
      "hash64": "C9FA90C14333E479",
      "text": "D[VAR 0x1107(00FF,0C0E)]ie Professoriner Professor hat von innen geholfen.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1107",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0C0E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_bbteacher_02",
      "hash64": "4E2F8564BCE0CDA3",
      "text": "Verstehe... Du hattest also einige Vorkehrungen\\ngetroffen und wurdest von jemandem innerhalb\\r\\ndes Labors unterstützt.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_system_04",
      "hash64": "A8A6F8EA807AAFCC",
      "text": "*biep* *bup*",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_machinevoice_01",
      "hash64": "1A19826A4619A0FF",
      "text": "Indigoblaue Scheibe wurde erkannt.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_machinevoice_02",
      "hash64": "1A19836A4619A2B2",
      "text": "Indigoblaue Scheibe wurde erkannt.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_brother_01",
      "hash64": "1395092E5B93D9B2",
      "text": "Hä? W-Woher kam diese Stimme?![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_machinevoice_03",
      "hash64": "1A19846A4619A465",
      "text": "Zugangsberechtigungen können durch Einlegen\\nder Indigoblauen Scheibe erweitert werden.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_machinevoice_04",
      "hash64": "1A197D6A46199880",
      "text": "Bitte Indigoblaue Scheibe einlegen.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_sister_02",
      "hash64": "B59D80DD3BCB7D31",
      "text": "Das ist nur ein Computer, der da spricht.\\nWie bei einer TM-Maschine oder so.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_brother_02",
      "hash64": "1395082E5B93D7FF",
      "text": "...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_bbteacher_03",
      "hash64": "4E2F8464BCE0CBF0",
      "text": "Was es mit dieser „Indigoblauen Scheibe“\\nwohl auf sich hat?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_bbteacher_04",
      "hash64": "4E2F8B64BCE0D7D5",
      "text": "Aha, Señora Sagaria hat dir also einen\\nmysteriösen Gegenstand überlassen,\\r\\nder damit gemeint sein könnte?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 107,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_sister_03",
      "hash64": "B59D7FDD3BCB7B7E",
      "text": "Hey, keine schlechte Idee! Los, probier’s damit\\nmal aus, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_machinevoice_05",
      "hash64": "1A197E6A46199A33",
      "text": "Bitte Indigoblaue Scheibe einlegen.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_select_03",
      "hash64": "C9FA8FC14333E2C6",
      "text": "Einlegen",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_select_04",
      "hash64": "C9FA92C14333E7DF",
      "text": "Nicht einlegen",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_machinevoice_06",
      "hash64": "1A197F6A46199BE6",
      "text": "Prüfungsvorgang abgeschlossen. Authentizität\\nder Indigoblauen Scheibe wurde bestätigt.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_machinevoice_07",
      "hash64": "1A19806A46199D99",
      "text": "Aufzug von Labor Null wird rekonfiguriert...\\nUmleitung auf neues Ziel: [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Höhlensystem Null[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_system_05",
      "hash64": "A8A6F9EA807AB17F",
      "text": "*ratter*",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_brother_03",
      "hash64": "1395072E5B93D64C",
      "text": "Es hat sich geöffnet...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_sister_04",
      "hash64": "B59D82DD3BCB8097",
      "text": "Also dann... Gehen wir weiter![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_brother_04",
      "hash64": "1395062E5B93D499",
      "text": "Ist das Legendäre Pokémon dadrinnen...?[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_sister_05",
      "hash64": "B59D81DD3BCB7EE4",
      "text": "Na los, geh du vor![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_bbteacher_05",
      "hash64": "4E2F8A64BCE0D622",
      "text": "Wer hätte gedacht, dass die Scheibe, die dir\\nSeñora Sagaria anvertraut hat, ein Schlüssel ist...\\c\\nWelch glänzende Überraschung![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
